    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay good to know. one more thing though—the bumps are kinda weirdly shaped, like they're more like small piles or little mounds rather than just worm tunnels. and i've been finding these tiny little scuff marks in the dirt, almost like something small was scurrying around at night. could that be related to the nutrient deficiency or is it just some other pest i'm not seeing?",
